<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1">=F0=9F=8C=B1 Design Pr=
inciples for Scalable Type Systems</h4>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>From Experience t=E1=BA=
=A1i Large Codebases:</strong> Managing TypeScript t=E1=BA=A1i scale (500k+=
