d:</p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Type Locality:</strong>=
 Related types should be co-located</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Dependency Inversion:</=
strong> High-level types shouldn't depend on low-level types</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Interface Segregation:<=
/strong> Large interfaces should be split into focused contracts</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Open/Closed Principle:<=
/strong> Types should be open for extension, closed for modification</li>
</ol>
